<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ruleset name="Java 共通規範" xmlns="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0 https://pmd.sourceforge.io/ruleset_2_0_0.xsd">
  <description>依 tools/java/rule-map.yml 建立；候選規則不在預設集合。</description>
  <!-- JV-SR-010 -->
  <rule name="EnumOrdinalAtBoundary" language="java" class="net.sourceforge.pmd.lang.rule.xpath.XPathRule" message="[JV-SR-010] 穩定的外部代碼 → rules/stacks/java/common/states-and-results.md#java-stable-external-codes" externalInfoUrl="https://github.com/clarkeforwork-coder/dev-rule/blob/main/rules/stacks/java/common/states-and-results.md#java-stable-external-codes">
    <description>只可套用已確認屬外部代碼的映射來源檔或以理由抑制；XPath 本身不識別邊界，內部 ordinal 索引可合法且已實測誤報，禁止全域直接阻擋；不能證明代碼穩定性；已實跑；未通過違反命中或符合不誤報時屬淘汰候選，不是可啟用規則；；實證版本：8、17。</description>
    <priority>1</priority>
    <properties>
      <property name="xpath"><value><![CDATA[//MethodCall[pmd-java:matchesSig('java.lang.Enum#ordinal()')]]]></value></property>
    </properties>
  </rule>
</ruleset>
